  "prefLabel": "Plc 303.02 Timing of Third Party Examinations Relative to Applications",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 303.02 Timing of Third Party Examinations Relative to Applications. If applicable law requires applicants to obtain prior permission from the applicable board to take an examination from a third party testing organization, the applicant shall submit an application for licensure prior to registering for and taking the examination.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Plc 300) #13606, eff 5-1-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc300.html"
